OL,3,GNEWSAFood price cap plans giving farmer
OL,4,A'sleepless nights'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs a farmer, Jamie Wyllie is used to
OL,7,Fgetting by on little sleep. His job
OL,8,Frequires long hours and hard graft.
OL,10,FBut now he said something else is
OL,11,Fkeeping him up at night ` the prospect
OL,12,Fof the Scottish government introducing
OL,13,Fprice caps for some essential food
OL,14,Fitems.
OL,16,FMinisters say that the big supermarket
OL,17,Fchains will take the financial hit,
OL,18,Finsisting "bold action" is needed to
OL,19,Fhelp households.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
