OL,3,GNEWSAFood price cap plans giving farmer
OL,4,A'sleepless nights'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Wyllie's fear is that the costs
OL,7,Fwill get passed down the production
OL,8,Fchain, and ultimately come to rest with
OL,9,Fhis family farm which is making "little
OL,10,Fto no margin as it is".
